{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object found, take it and do task, then move to new location, else approach visible object or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Action ID = MoveToNextLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    />\"",
